  "preamble": "Deglottalization of the lateral ejective affricate: in Lower Tanana and partly Tanacross (Athabaskan), stem-final *tɬʼ lost its glottalization but kept its affricate articulation, giving plain [tɬ], parallel to the Tanana deglottalization of *tʼ and *tsʼ.",
